gantt
    title Article one to publication (as of Oct 6)
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %d

    section Session start
    Recheck public link (H1)          :h1, 2026-10-06, 1d
    Phone pass (H2)                   :h2, after h1, 1d
    Print check (H3)                  :h3, after h1, 1d
    Spreads or single charts (H4)     :milestone, h4, 2026-10-08, 0d

    section Outreach
    NASS reply window (B2)            :crit, b2, 2026-10-05, 2026-10-17
    Kim approvals (C3)                :c3, 2026-10-05, 2026-10-10
    Grower replies (B3)               :b3, 2026-10-05, 2026-10-12
    Direct-grower fallback            :b3b, 2026-10-12, 2026-10-16
    Grower slot decision (B4)         :milestone, b4, 2026-10-16, 0d

    section Editorial
    Aaron voice pass (C2)             :crit, c2, 2026-10-06, 2026-10-15
    Insert source URLs (C8)           :c8, after c2, 1d
    Fill slots (C9)                   :crit, c9, 2026-10-16, 2026-10-17

    section Photos
    Sorrentino direct license (D2)    :d2, 2026-10-05, 2026-10-12
    Buy and swap licensed files (D3)  :d3, 2026-10-13, 2d

    section Pitch and publish
    Check Offrange AI policy (F1)     :f1, 2026-10-06, 2d
    Send Offrange pitch (F2)          :milestone, f2, 2026-10-09, 0d
    One-week wait (F3)                :f3, 2026-10-09, 2026-10-16
    Final QA (F4)                     :crit, f4, 2026-10-17, 1d
    Publish (F5)                      :crit, milestone, f5, 2026-10-17, 0d

    section Portfolio
    README write-up (G1)              :g1, 2026-10-13, 2026-10-21
